  "knownGaps": [
    "Aviation Chat and the G1000 frontend have production builds but no package-owned test command.",
    "The Missions frontend test command is an explicit no-op and ForeFlight frontend permits an empty Vitest suite.",
    "The retained root npm scripts use npm workspace traversal even though pnpm is the pinned package manager; Make and CI are the current build authorities.",
    "Python, Go, and Clojure dependencies are outside pnpm's graph and remain explicitly orchestrated by Make, Docker, and CI."
